{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_15.gif?t=1744534771\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I'm Kazfiel Balthioul Tabbris.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In short, <strong>Kaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the game where being an asshole to your friends <strong>is actually a good thing!</strong>\u00a0In Haphazard Angel, 2-4 players take on the hilariously challenging task of controlling a single, magnificent <i>(and often unwieldy)</i> angel. You each control one of its four glorious wings, meaning teamwork is essential... <strong>until it isn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/Haphazard_Headers__3_.gif?t=1744534771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share the Burden, Share the Chaos!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2-4 players</strong> - Grab a  friend and some controllers, you'll have to work together to achieve objectives! Perfect for parties and game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 Angel, 4 Wings</strong>\u00a0- Each player controls one wing, but you all share a single body. OUR body. Communication is key\u2014good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 Deadly Sins - </strong>Choose a wing inspired by the seven deadly sins. Each one comes with its own strengths and weaknesses\u2014some complement, others clash. Can you make it work?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/Haphazard_Headers__6_.gif?t=1744534771\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[STORY MODE]</strong> Stairway to heaven, or highway to hell. <strong>Your destiny awaits.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stripped of your grace and cast into purgatory, you face a monumental choice: <strong>ascend 10,000 meters</strong> of treacherous obstacles on the Stairway to Heaven to reclaim your place, or descend <strong>10,000 meters down</strong> the perilous Highway to Hell in search of\u2026 something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Begin your journey in the murky depths and commit to your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/Haphazard_Headers__8_.gif?t=1744534771\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[ARCADE MODE]</strong> Several Ways To Win. Find Them All!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cooperating is a must - </strong>Kaz can't get anywhere with one wing. Collecting halos can get Kaz back to heaven!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Competing is inevitable\u00a0</strong>- Only one wing can pick up halos and evil essences. The more each player picks up, the stronger their influence over Kazfiel gets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/Haphazard_Headers__7_.gif?t=1744534771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The controls are simple:</strong> flap your wings, navigate the chaos, and work (or fight) with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re playing couch co-op or online, Haphazard Angel delivers the perfect mix of fun and frustration!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2363160?t=1744534771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744534771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=174453